              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chefwannabee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Unfortunately, watercress is not available in my community but I substituted with mixed greens. Best Waldorf Salad I've ever had, dressing was a great finish and capped a flavorful treat. Only change I'll make is to add create a thicker dressing but with the same taste.",
