              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nanby"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The watercress fit beautifully into this wonderful salad. I didn't have any apple juice on hand, so subbed some orange juice and added a touch sugar to balance. I also used one sweet apple and one tart only. The salad looked elegant on the plates and delicious. I think this should be called \"Waldorf Watercress Salad\" so people can see the special ingredient when just browsing. But anyway a lovely dish. Thank-you",
            "datePublished": "2014-09-17T12:04:42.203Z"
