            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joeler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yup, had this at family gatherings fairly often when I was a kid so decided to make it for the big family BBQ last weekend. Onions omitted (picky eaters), no celery seed, watercress unavailable and only had pecans on hand (smashing flavor!) and also toasted up some pumpkin seeds for an extra bit of crunch. A big hit! First salad to vanish from the table. A real keeper, this one.",
